    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:173cf987634ed90a",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "3affbfc9ecc81be278e6574e0ca1da6857f30b83451af58f23d7b0d8de3ab349",
      "text": "The lodge provides **full board** and a programme of excursions.\n\nThe day may begin with an early jungle walk, as the forest wakes up and wildlife is especially active.\n\nOne of the activities is **piranha fishing**.\n\nThe programme also includes a visit to the local Indigenous **Boras** community.\n\nAnother stop is an animal facility where you can see animals native to the Amazon forests.\n\nOn the river, you will look for **pink dolphins**.\n\nIn the evening, you can watch the sunset over the Amazon.\n\nThe night programme takes you by canoe across the lake and along jungle tributaries, with **caiman spotting** as its main focus.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw376c69-amanda",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "Verified Word paragraph 125 compresses the activities into one sentence and specifies a wildlife rescue centre; the RU describes an animal facility without that status and gives distinct conditional activity paragraphs, so translate RU while retaining all activities and modality."
      }
    },
